I have enough information from the manual files. Here is the 18-scene illustrated story plan.

```json
{
  "title": "The Bridge of Silver Banners",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "scene_number": 1,
      "caption": "The rescue team arrives at the ruined outer gate.",
      "visual_description": "A crumbling stone gate flanked by broken statues, with an iron portcullis half-lifted. Weathered royal banners hang from the arch. Three figures stand on the drawbridge: a map reader, a scout, and a magic helper.",
      "characters": ["map_reader", "scout", "magic_helper"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 2,
      "caption": "Frightened townspeople whisper in the market street.",
      "visual_description": "A cobblestone market square with empty stalls and torn canvas awnings. Citizens huddle in doorways, pointing toward a distant spire. The scout asks a vendor for directions.",
      "characters": ["scout", "townspeople", "vendor"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 3,
      "caption": "Armored patrols block the main avenue.",
      "visual_description": "Four iron-clad guards in crested helms stand shoulder-to-shoulder across a wide street. Their captain holds a pike. The team ducks behind a collapsed cart.",
      "characters": ["map_reader", "scout", "magic_helper", "patrol_guard_captain", "patrol_guards"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 4,
      "caption": "A rumor of dragons draws the team to the old plaza.",
      "visual_description": "An open plaza with a cracked fountain shaped like a wyrm. Charred banners flutter from the clock tower. The magic helper examines a large scorch mark on the stones.",
      "characters": ["map_reader", "scout", "magic_helper"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 5,
      "caption": "They find the cursed tower door sealed by a glowing rune.",
      "visual_description": "A squat tower door etched with blue runes that pulse in sequence. Ivy clings to the stonework. A small brass compass lies on the threshold, its needle spinning.",
      "characters": ["map_reader", "scout", "magic_helper"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 6,
      "caption": "The magic helper decodes the door's riddle lock.",
      "visual_description": "Close-up of the magic helper’s hand tracing a rune ring. The runes shift from blue to warm amber. The map reader holds a torn banner with a matching symbol.",
      "characters": ["map_reader", "scout", "magic_helper"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 7,
      "caption": "Inside the tower, a spiral staircase ascends through dust.",
      "visual_description": "A narrow spiral stair with a rope railing. Broken shields lean against the wall. The scout climbs first, crossbow ready.",
      "characters": ["map_reader", "scout", "magic_helper"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 8,
      "caption": "A mirror hall reflects the team's doubts.",
      "visual_description": "An octagonal room with tall silver mirrors. The team’s reflections appear distorted—the map reader’s reflection shows a different path. A single crystal key hangs from the ceiling at the room's center.",
      "characters": ["map_reader", "scout", "magic_helper"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 9,
      "caption": "The scout shatters the false reflection with a thrown dagger.",
      "visual_description": "A mirror cracks from a dagger thrown at the center. The crystal key drops. The map reader catches it as the room shimmers.",
      "characters": ["map_reader", "scout", "magic_helper"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 10,
      "caption": "They rescue the captive from the top chamber.",
      "visual_description": "A round room with a single barred window. A young official with a sleepy face sits on a heap of old banners, wearing an oversized helmet. The magic helper unlocks the cell door with the crystal key.",
      "characters": ["map_reader", "scout", "magic_helper", "sleepy_official"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 11,
      "caption": "The alarm is raised as guards fill the courtyard below.",
      "visual_description": "From the tower window, the team sees a courtyard swarming with armored guards. Torches are lit along the walls. The sleepy official yawns.",
      "characters": ["map_reader", "scout", "magic_helper", "sleepy_official", "patrol_guards"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 12,
      "caption": "A secret passage behind a false banner leads down.",
      "visual_description": "A dusty stone staircase revealed when the sleepy official pulls a frayed banner. Spiderwebs break as the team descends with a single lantern.",
      "characters": ["map_reader", "scout", "magic_helper", "sleepy_official"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 13,
      "caption": "The passage empties into the bridge control room.",
      "visual_description": "A small chamber with a wooden lever on a stone pedestal. A view slit shows the escape bridge beyond the city wall. The map reader consults the brass compass.",
      "characters": ["map_reader", "scout", "magic_helper", "sleepy_official"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 14,
      "caption": "They lift the bridge portcullis with the ancient lever.",
      "visual_description": "The map reader and scout pull the lever together. Chains rattle through overhead gears. Outside, the bridge portcullis rises inch by inch.",
      "characters": ["map_reader", "scout", "magic_helper", "sleepy_official"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 15,
      "caption": "Guards pour into the control room stairwell.",
      "visual_description": "A stone stairwell below the control room, with guard helmets appearing around the corner. The magic helper seals the door with a quick rune.",
      "characters": ["map_reader", "scout", "magic_helper", "sleepy_official", "patrol_guards"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 16,
      "caption": "The team races across the bridge under arrow fire.",
      "visual_description": "A long stone bridge over a misty ravine. Arrows bounce off the parapet. The scout covers the rear, the sleepy official stumbles, and the map reader drags them forward.",
      "characters": ["map_reader", "scout", "magic_helper", "sleepy_official", "patrol_guards"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 17,
      "caption": "The magic helper collapses the bridge behind them.",
      "visual_description": "The magic helper raises a glowing palm. The bridge stones crack and tumble into the ravine in a cloud of dust. The guards stop at the broken edge.",
      "characters": ["map_reader", "scout", "magic_helper", "sleepy_official", "patrol_guards"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 18,
      "caption": "The rescue team rests on the far hill as dawn breaks.",
      "visual_description": "A grassy hilltop with a view of the ruined city across the broken bridge. Morning light touches the old banners on the towers. The sleepy official removes the oversized helmet and smiles.",
      "characters": ["map_reader", "scout", "magic_helper", "sleepy_official"]
    }
  ]
}
```

